  "sentences": {
    "total": "Felsenstein's catalog documents 407 phylogenetics software tools spanning over four decades of development.",
    "status": "Of 407 tools, 34 (8.4%) are completely unreachable, 137 (33.7%) appear dormant, and 196 (48.2%) are archived but no longer actively maintained.",
